{"parse":{"title":"极限解放/幻梦真知","pageid":7176,"revid":17010,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%B9%BB%E6%A2%A6%E7%9C%9F%E7%9F%A5&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%B9%BB%E6%A2%A6%E7%9C%9F%E7%9F%A5&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE/%E5%B9%BB%E6%A2%A6%E7%9C%9F%E7%9F%A5&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>幻梦真知</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.B9.BB.E6.A2.A6.E7.9C.9F.E7.9F.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"幻梦真知\"><b>幻梦真知</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">极限解放详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"3\"><img alt=\"极限解放 幻梦真知.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/59/2dxnbd6vapbch1mdx16m35n05u9y0q1.png/80px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%B9%BB%E6%A2%A6%E7%9C%9F%E7%9F%A5.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/5/59/2dxnbd6vapbch1mdx16m35n05u9y0q1.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%B9%BB%E6%A2%A6%E7%9C%9F%E7%9F%A5.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/59/2dxnbd6vapbch1mdx16m35n05u9y0q1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />幻梦真知\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"指定技能\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">指定技能</font></span></span>]拥有额外效果：攻击时，穿透伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护</font></span></span>]标签。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">卜梦游戏</font></span>]拥有额外效果:释放非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]攻击后，治疗自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内其他友军，治疗量为魔攻值<font color=\"#58cb48\">15%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"指定技能\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">指定技能</font></span></span>]拥有额外效果：攻击时，穿透伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护</font></span></span>]标签。<br />✦战斗开始时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲最大射程1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▲最大射程1</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">卜梦游戏</font></span>]拥有额外效果:释放非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]攻击后，治疗自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内其他友军，治疗量为魔攻值<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"指定技能\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">指定技能</font></span></span>]拥有额外效果：攻击时，穿透伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>，并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无视守护\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">无视守护</font></span></span>]标签。<br />✦战斗开始时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲最大射程1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▲最大射程1</font></span></span>]，持续至战斗结束。处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰冻\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冰冻</font></span></span>]地形时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。<br />✦技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">卜梦游戏</font></span>]拥有额外效果:释放非[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]攻击后，治疗自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内其他友军，治疗量为魔攻值<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>。<br />✦鹿灵形态下，拥有额外技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">冰灾预言</font></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:8